cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "PC Game System Requirements & Estimated FPS by GPU"
authors:
  - name: "PCGameBenchmarks"
    website: "https://pcgamebenchmarks.com"
date-released: 2026-10-03
version: "2026-10-03"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://pcgamebenchmarks.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/emilioagustin83/pc-game-fps-dataset"
abstract: >-
  System requirements for 17,400+ PC games (as listed on Steam) and estimated
  1080p High frame rates on 12 reference GPUs, plus G3D benchmark scores for
  1,381 GPUs. FPS figures come from the PCGameBenchmarks model, calibrated
  against 2,070 measured benchmark results.
keywords:
  - pc games
  - system requirements
  - gpu
  - fps
  - benchmarks
